	<li class="comment odd alt thread-odd thread-alt depth-1" id="li-comment-772">
		<article id="comment-772" class="comment">
			<header class="comment-meta comment-author vcard">
				<img referrerpolicy="no-referrer" alt='Antonio&#039;s avatar' src='https://1.gravatar.com/avatar/160d3de47ed5a3402de766e8db1279ef2e75ddc77d2747fed3de9f89553698fb?s=44&#038;d=identicon&#038;r=G' srcset='https://1.gravatar.com/avatar/160d3de47ed5a3402de766e8db1279ef2e75ddc77d2747fed3de9f89553698fb?s=44&#038;d=identicon&#038;r=G 1x, https://1.gravatar.com/avatar/160d3de47ed5a3402de766e8db1279ef2e75ddc77d2747fed3de9f89553698fb?s=66&#038;d=identicon&#038;r=G 1.5x, https://1.gravatar.com/avatar/160d3de47ed5a3402de766e8db1279ef2e75ddc77d2747fed3de9f89553698fb?s=88&#038;d=identicon&#038;r=G 2x, https://1.gravatar.com/avatar/160d3de47ed5a3402de766e8db1279ef2e75ddc77d2747fed3de9f89553698fb?s=132&#038;d=identicon&#038;r=G 3x, https://1.gravatar.com/avatar/160d3de47ed5a3402de766e8db1279ef2e75ddc77d2747fed3de9f89553698fb?s=176&#038;d=identicon&#038;r=G 4x' class='avatar avatar-44' height='44' width='44' loading='lazy' decoding='async' /><cite><b class="fn">Antonio</b> </cite><a href="https://sfkittens.wordpress.com/2016/05/29/gene-wolfe-for-n00bs-an-interview-with-marc-aramini/#comment-772"><time datetime="2016-05-30T03:21:33+02:00">May 30, 2016 at 03:21</time></a>			</header><!-- .comment-meta -->

				
				
			<section class="comment-content comment">
				<p>@Katter, I&#8217;m not even an English speaker so I certainly have little to do with what seems to be an American controversy. From a distance, it looks like someone tried to counter perceived establishment groupthink with terrorism and it&#8217;s hard to be sympathetic with either side. For sure &#8216;slate&#8217; voting goes against the contest, but then again so does having nominations with no escape valve </p>
<p>What I do know is that the merit of a given work has nothing to do with how it gets nominated. If you&#8217;re suspicious whether it&#8217;s a worthy read or not, you&#8217;re free to skip it, but not to judge it on that criterion.</p>
<p id="comment-like-772" data-liked=comment-not-liked class="comment-likes comment-not-liked"><a href="https://sfkittens.wordpress.com/2016/05/29/gene-wolfe-for-n00bs-an-interview-with-marc-aramini/?like_comment=772&#038;_wpnonce=14a16d3856" class="comment-like-link needs-login" rel="nofollow" data-blog="85585660"><span>Like</span></a><span id="comment-like-count-772" class="comment-like-feedback">Like</span></p>
							</section><!-- .comment-content -->

				<div class="reply">
				<a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="https://sfkittens.wordpress.com/2016/05/29/gene-wolfe-for-n00bs-an-interview-with-marc-aramini/?replytocom=772#respond" data-commentid="772" data-postid="2582" data-belowelement="comment-772" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Reply to Antonio" aria-label="Reply to Antonio">Reply</a> <span>&darr;</span>				</div><!-- .reply -->
			</article><!-- #comment-## -->
