		<p>Pingback: <a href="http://www.castaliahouse.com/marc-aramini-on-classics-critics-the-new-wave-and-seventies-culture/" class="url" rel="ugc external nofollow">Marc Aramini on Classics, Critics, the New Wave, and Seventies Culture &#8211; castaliahouse.com</a> </p>
	</li><!-- #comment-## -->
